A module that does not compile fails the requiring cell at the
`require`:

``` {.lmd .code-with-copy}
local m = require("modules/broken")
return m.go()
```

A module that raises names its own file and line:

``` {.lmd .code-with-copy}
local m = require("modules/boom")
local r = m.go()
return r
```
